      "id": "claim_3f404acf3a284594b2d0c12df0a649aa",
      "statement": "The renderer (React 19 + Zustand + immer) talks to the Rust shell only through the SlrBridge interface (src/platform/bridge.ts): it cannot touch the filesystem, spawn git, or call an LLM provider itself. The only production bridge implementation is TauriAdapter, whose every call maps to a #[tauri::command] registered in src-tauri/src/main.rs, and getBridge() throws 'No desktop bridge: SaiLoR runs in the Tauri shell only' when no bridge was injected.",
